OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GHOW DID YOU COME TO JOIN THE BBC? WAS
OL,7,GBROADCASTING ALWAYS AN AMBITION OF
OL,8,GYOURS, OR DID IT EMERGE AS A NATURAL
OL,9,GPROGRESSION FROM PRINT JOURNALISM?
OL,11,F"I had always wanted to work for the
OL,12,FBBC and was accepted at my third
OL,13,Fattempt."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G3/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT WERE THE ROLES YOU DID AT BBC
OL,7,GBIRMINGHAM AND IS IT TRUE YOU WERE THE
OL,8,GFIRST FEMALE JOURNALIST IN THE
OL,9,GREGIONAL NEWSROOM?
OL,11,F"Yes true. I was a regional journalist
OL,12,Fbut fronted/produced/directed a few
OL,13,Fregional half-hour documentaries.
OL,15,F"I also wrote the BBC Guide to
OL,16,FAdventure Play, after producing weekly
OL,17,Fitems on our own Adventure playground
OL,18,Fat Pebble Mill. HRH Price Phillip wrote
OL,19,Fthe forward as President of the
OL,20,FNational Playing Fields Association."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14304
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G4/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Later in 1992, I returned to Pebble
OL,7,FMill to work as senior
OL,8,Freporter/producer on Good Morning with
OL,9,FAnne and Nick. I covered the James
OL,10,FBulger case and his funeral live."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14305
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G5/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GDID YOU HAVE AN ATTACHMENT TO THE
OL,7,GLONDON NEWSROOM?
OL,9,F"No, my attachment was to Radio Stoke,
OL,10,Fwhere I presented the breakfast show
OL,11,Ffor six months at the time of the
OL,12,FLesley Whittle kidnap case.
OL,14,F"I was also working in the Midlands
OL,15,Fnewsroom at the time of the Birmingham
OL,16,Fpub bombings."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14306
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G6/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT ARE YOUR MEMORIES OF COLLEAGUES
OL,7,GLIKE TOM COYNE, ALAN TOWERS, KAY
OL,8,GALEXANDER AND BOB WARMAN?
OL,10,F"Tom was a distant man, hard to read.
OL,12,F"Alan was a tremendous fun colleague
OL,13,Fand friend.
OL,15,F"I started at the BBC the same day as
OL,16,FKay and we were good friends.
OL,18,F"Bob and I worked together on screen,
OL,19,Fbut I also freelanced for his
OL,20,Fproduction company for some years. He
OL,21,Fis a charming person and we got on
OL,22,Fextremely well."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14307
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G7/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GCAN YOU RECALL WHEN IN 1980 YOU MOVED
OL,7,GOVER FROM THE BBC TO ITV? WERE YOU
OL,8,GHEADHUNTED OR DID YOU ANSWER AN
OL,9,GADVERT?
OL,11,F"I was headhunted, via the agent Paul
OL,12,FVaughan, as the controller of news
OL,13,FTerry Johnston was looking for a female
OL,14,Fco-presenter for ATV Today. Anne
OL,15,FDiamond was a reporter at the time.
OL,17,F"I wrote a book about Britain's first
OL,18,Ftransexual couple The Gender Trap,
OL,19,Fafter filming them for Central News.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14308
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G8/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Both were medically proven to be in
OL,7,Fthe wrong bodies and both went through
OL,8,Fsex change treatment after having their
OL,9,Fchild.
OL,11,F"I also worked as a presenter on a
OL,12,Fmotoring series, motor show specials
OL,13,Fand Format Five, the regional
OL,14,Fdocumentary series."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
