OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GDO YOU HAVE THE DATE WHEN YOU STOPPED
OL,7,GPRESENTING CENTRAL NEWS?
OL,9,F"It was early 1984."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14311
SC,0011
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G11/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GWAS IT YOUR DECISION TO MOVE BEHIND
OL,7,GTHE CAMERA INTO AN EDITORIAL ROLE AND
OL,8,GDID YOU ENJOY IT?
OL,10,F"Yes, it was.
OL,12,F"Mike Hollingsworth was leaving to join
OL,13,Fbreakfast TV and his job became vacant.
OL,15,F"I loved it, although at first it was
OL,16,Fchallenging to be in charge of 40+
OL,17,Fstaff, mainly men.
OL,19,F"I introduced The Friday Show, Central
OL,20,FNews live for an hour every Friday,
OL,21,Fhosted by Chris Tarrant with Jimmy
OL,22,FGreaves.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14312
SC,0012
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G12/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Guests included Mohammed Ali and
OL,7,FDennis Healey ` a wide spectrum.
OL,9,F"I moved to produce the Motor Show
OL,10,FSpecial for ITV Network during 1984,
OL,11,Fbefore leaving to have my daughter."
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
