OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GDID YOU ENJOY RETURNING TO PRESENT THE
OL,7,GLATE BULLETINS?
OL,9,F"It was tiring, but lucrative!"
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14314
SC,0014
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G14/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT PROGRAMMES DID YOU WORK ON FOR
OL,7,GVARIOUS CHANNELS FROM 1985 TO 2008?
OL,9,F"Find a Family, recurring series
OL,10,Ffinding homes for children in care
OL,11,F(1986 ` 1992). It began as regional ITV
OL,12,Finserts, then a regional series and a
OL,13,Fnetwork series ` including Christmas
OL,14,FDay Special for four years. An idea I
OL,15,Foriginated and series
OL,16,Fproduced/directed.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14315
SC,0015
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G15/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F"First time such a programme had aired
OL,7,Fanywhere in the world. We worked
OL,8,Falongside Social Service departments
OL,9,Fnationwide, including Northern Ireland;
OL,10,Finvolving them in working, for the
OL,11,Ffirst time, cross-county in finding
OL,12,Fadoption and long-term fostering
OL,13,Ffamilies for difficult to place
OL,14,Fchildren ` i.e., disabled, older,
OL,15,Fautistic, five siblings together etc.
OL,17,F"Viewers responded first by phone
OL,18,Fbanks, set up in every ITV studio and
OL,19,Fmanned by social workers.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14316
SC,0016
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G16/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was mentioned and praised in the
OL,7,FHouse of Commons, via the late Liberal
OL,8,Fleader David Steel MP and there was
OL,9,Fcoverage by international newspapers.
OL,11,F- Reporter/presenter on Heart of the
OL,12,FCountry: several series of half-hour
OL,13,Fprogrammes for Central TV;
OL,15,F- Researcher on Green and Pleasant
OL,16,FLand: countryside major documentary for
OL,17,FChannel 4;
OL,19,F- Associate producer for a German TV
OL,20,Fdocumentary on the birth of football
OL,21,Fvia West Bromwich Albion;
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14317
SC,0017
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F143A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G17/19
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with former TV news
OL,4,Cpresenter Wendy Nelson
OL,5,
OL,6,F- Directed Out and About ` a series for
OL,7,FBBC Bristol and Midlands. Presented by
OL,8,FSuzanne Dando and Chris Serle;
OL,10,F- Associate producer on Through the
OL,11,FKeyhole for David Frost productions;
OL,13,F- Producer on Star Lives ` recurring
OL,14,Flight entertainment ITV series
OL,15,Fpresented by Carol Vorderman. It won an
OL,16,FRTS award for Best Light Entertainment
OL,17,FShow.
OL,19,F"I also presented for live cookery
OL,20,Fshows at the NEC, for Shell, video and
OL,21,Fvoice training for West Midlands
OL,22,FPolice, West Midlands Psychiatrists.
OL,23,EPub: 13-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,144,140,120,200,0,100
